# Demo bundles under demos/ are copied in from other repos and sometimes carry
# their own host config. Only a ROOT-level _headers/_redirects is interpreted by
# Workers, so a nested one would just be served as a public file. Drop them.
#
# Caveat: this pattern is recursive, so if this site ever needs its own
# root-level dist/_headers, add a "!_headers" negation below or it gets dropped too.
**/_headers
**/_redirects
